challenge :
while the u . s . economy has been sluggish , e - commerce has never been hotter ! according to forrester research , u . s . retail e - commerce sales eclipsed $ 136 . 6 billion in 2004 , an increase of 20 % from 2003 .
put another way : e - commerce grew three times faster than retail sales as a whole for the same period !
but there is a dark cloud on the horizon . there are more than 22 million small businesses in the u . s . , the vast majority with fewer than a dozen employees . they represent 50 % of the entire u . s . economy and 75 % of all new jobs . . . and yet these businesses find it increasingly difficult to cash in on the e - commerce revolution . it ' s becoming harder and harder to design and maintain online stores . . . set up merchant accounts . . . control web - based inventories . . . and package and ship products .
as consumers increasingly demand web catalogs and instant online shopping , millions of small businesses are missing out .
without a state of the art web site . . . a wide variety of competitively - priced products and services . . . and cutting - edge ordering and payment options . . . these small businesses and entrepreneurs are losing billions of dollars in potential profits .
and because small businesses provide most of the new jobs in america , the ripple effect of this failure to offer online shopping could dramatically slow down the economic recovery of the country as a whole .
plus , that ' s only half of the problem . there are millions more people and businesses that would like to sell items on ebay . . . but they either don ' t own computers or don ' t want to be bothered with listing and photographing items on ebay .
. nwwv has the ultimate solution
fortunately , nwwv has developed easy , cost - effective solutions to these e - commerce challenges !
first : nwwv , through its web portal online supplier . com , helps small businesses and entrepreneurs get in on the e - commerce revolution by providing a turn key online store with dynamic content . . . hundreds of products selling at up to 50 % below retail price . . . access to merchant account services . . . and direct shipping to buyers . for a small monthly fee , nwwv allows businesses to have an instant online retail presence .
second : nwwv ' s other subsidiary , auction liquidator , has established a relationship with fedex to provide it with nationwide network of drop - off centers that will let anyone to sell an item on ebay by just dropping it off at any one of the 5 , 000 fedex or kinkos locations without ever touching a computer . auctionliquidator will handle the entire transaction for the seller and simply send him or her a check once the item sells .
