"call hi louise ,
welcome back !
i trust everything is ok at home ? how are you coping ?
my assistant told me that you tried to call me . . . . . . . . what ' s the subject ? , general catch - up ? , want to know what zhiyong wants to see you for , pick up where we left off ?
